"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"For general maintenance, a Deep Tissue Massage every 2–4 weeks is beneficial. For those with chronic pain or athletic recovery needs, weekly sessions may be ideal under professional guidance.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script>"
